  "主要内容": "Epizyme Inc. (EPZM) and Intrexon Corp. (XON) were top-performing IPOs of 2013, with EPZM's stock rising 53.2% on its first day of trading to $22.99, and XON's stock increasing 54.6% to an unspecified price. Both companies are in the biotechnology and industrial sectors. Sprouts Farmers Market Inc. (SFM) also had a strong IPO performance, with shares opening at $35 and closing at $40.11, a 123% gain over the $18 offering price. The S&P 500 rose 18.4% for the year, contributing to the success of these IPOs.",
